    "about_story": {
      "type": "about-story",
      "blocks": {
        "paragraph_1": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>It started with events. Then came design. And eventually, design became something you could hold.</em></p>",
            "style": "body"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_2": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>My journey began in event planning, amidst tight deadlines, endless checklists, and the beautiful chaos of bringing ideas to life. Somewhere along the way, I found myself drawn to the art of designing experiences and creating moments worth remembering.</p>",
            "style": "body"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_3": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The days were hectic, the coffee was endless, and creativity kept brewing. What began as event planning slowly evolved into event design, graphic design, and a desire to create something more personal.</p>",
            "style": "body"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_4": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I wanted my designs to live beyond screens and event spaces — to become things people could hold, gift, use, and cherish.</p>",
            "style": "body"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_5": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>And so, <em>Graffeine Tales</em> was born: a blend of graphics and caffeine, fuelled by a love for art, handmade details, and the little things that bring joy.</p>",
            "style": "body"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_6": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Today, from illustrated stationery and personalised gifts to thread art and handmade keepsakes, every creation is a mix of thoughtful design and a little creative magic.</p>",
            "style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "paragraph_1",
        "paragraph_2",
        "paragraph_3",
        "paragraph_4",
        "paragraph_5",
        "paragraph_6"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "The Story Behind Graffeine Tales",
        "subheading": "Born from events. Brewed with coffee. Made with art.",
